WEBVTT

00:04:00.903 --> 00:04:04.210
If this works for grown people,

00:04:04.234 --> 00:04:06.907
why should it not work for a baby?

00:04:09.146 --> 00:04:14.034
I also learned that human beings
pick up fundamental patterns

00:04:14.058 --> 00:04:16.802
mainly between ages zero to five,

00:04:16.826 --> 00:04:18.253
and after that,

00:04:18.277 --> 00:04:21.696
consolidation of habits happens.

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:23.703
It was scary

00:04:24.593 --> 00:04:28.097
to realize that we may just
have five years

00:04:28.121 --> 00:04:31.320
to figure out the immobility of Lubuto.